  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Structured detail describing why a task failed. Projects the cross-language
            failure record (handler error vs. exhausted retries) into typed members.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            The original handler exception is also preserved as
            <see cref="P:System.Exception.InnerException" /> on the
            <see cref="T:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.Tasks.ResilientTaskException" /> (with a <see cref="P:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.Tasks.ResilientTaskErrorCode.HandlerError" /> or
            <see cref="P:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.Tasks.ResilientTaskErrorCode.ExhaustedRetries" /> code). <see cref="P:Azure.AI.AgentServer.Core.Tasks.TaskFailureDetail.Traceback" /> captures the same
            formatted stack trace as a string for cross-language parity with the persisted
            failure record.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
